# ***Registry Reporting***

Running a registry well means keeping processes efficient and reporting on progress along the way. Slate's registry metrics help with both.

You can analyze registration progress and throughput, then download and share what you find with stakeholders as charts or raw data.

These metrics also help you measure the impact of outreach. Whether you're running TV spots, mailers, or other campaigns, you can track and report on how each one moves registrations.

With these numbers at your fingertips, you can adjust your strategy as you go and report on registrations with confidence.

Want to get the most out of Slate metrics? [Contact our Customer Success team](mailto:support@tolemi.com).
